Error [E0047]: `?.` needs an optional on the left, but this is `Int (a whole number)`
  --> tests/ui/opt_chain_non_optional.jet:3:16
    |
  3 |     val y = x?.bits;
    |                ^^^^
 Why: optional chaining short-circuits a `T?` to absent on a missing link
 Fix: use plain `.` here, or make the value optional first
